<span class="ltx_bibblock">External Links: <span class="ltx_text ltx_bib_links"><a href="https://openreview.net/forum?id=27xTIAFbc6" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_bib_external">Link</a></span>
</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock ltx_bib_cited">Cited by: <a href="#S2.SS1.p2.1" title="2.1 Image Authentication ‣ 2 Background ‣ Naïve Exposure of Generative AI Capabilities Undermines Deepfake Detection" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">§2.1</span></a>.
</span></li>
